{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"codex-light-cones","chapterId":"item-ItemConfigEquipment-21028","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"codex-light-cones-item-ItemConfigEquipment-21028-item-ItemConfigEquipment-21028-0","text":"丰饶命途专属的光锥，光锥技能仅对该命途生效。","speaker":""},{"id":"codex-light-cones-item-ItemConfigEquipment-21028-item-ItemConfigEquipment-21028-1","text":"点一盏灯，捧一杯暖呼呼的巧克力，看着身旁的朋友。\n看着她阅读自己送的书和笔记。\n看着她露出平时见不到的笑容。\n\n在寒冷的夜晚，一点小小的幸福便能驱散寒意。","speaker":""}]}
